# Rewrites for statichost.eu (also understood by Netlify and Cloudflare Pages).
# The page asks for /api/weather on its own address (with latitude, longitude... for Warsaw, from live-config.js); the host forwards it to
# Open-Meteo and returns the answer, so visitors never contact Open-Meteo themselves.
# NOTE: statichost forwards only the query string the browser sends. A query written into the destination here is IGNORED (tried: the
# answer came back empty), so the location cannot be pinned in this file.
/api/weather  https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast  200
